From 21df62be3a694ee06e85e597279e49870e3315b5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IMD Ember <operator@imdember.invalid>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 03:41:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] Genesis GOLD: each payment token has its own GOLD price
 (imdUSD discount)

Owner 2026-10-29: the Genesis contract takes imdUSD v1 (1,200 GOLD), USDC added
right after deployment (1,600 GOLD) and imdUSD v2 later (1,200 GOLD); paying in
imdUSD is the GOLD discount. A registry entry lists the added tokens' GOLD
prices (addedTokenGoldCosts, at most two); an order is held only at one of the
deployment's prices. The order names no token: the contract checks the signed
goldCost against the token actually paid and reports it in PaidOrderConsumed,
which the reader already compares with the GOLD held.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 server/genesis-deployments.ts |  9 ++++++---
 server/genesis-gold.ts        | 16 ++++++++++------
 tests/genesis-gold.test.mjs   | 28 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 43 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

diff --git a/server/genesis-deployments.ts b/server/genesis-deployments.ts
index f46fcf8..324565d 100644
--- a/server/genesis-deployments.ts
+++ b/server/genesis-deployments.ts
@@ -1,8 +1,11 @@
 import type {GenesisDeployment} from './genesis-gold.ts';
 // Genesis deployments the GOLD book accepts paid orders for. Each entry pins chain, contract, runtime code hash, deploy
-// block, both immutable costs, the EIP-712 domain version and the payment recipient (read back from the deployed
-// contract before an entry is added).
-// Production is empty: the mainnet contract is not deployed and its payment token (imdUSD v1 or v2) is not decided, so
+// block, both immutable costs, the GOLD price of every added payment token, the EIP-712 domain version and the payment
+// recipient (read back from the deployed contract before an entry is added).
+// Owner 2026-10-29: mainnet pays in imdUSD v1 (1,200 GOLD); USDC (1,600 GOLD) is added right after deployment and
+// imdUSD v2 (1,200 GOLD) when it exists. The entry is added after USDC is added on chain, so it lists both prices from
+// the start; v2 has imdUSD's price already listed, so adding it changes nothing here.
+// Production is empty: the mainnet contract is not deployed, so
 // every reservation is refused (MINT_DEPLOYMENT_UNKNOWN) even if the mint control were switched on. The entry is added,
 // and this file re-reviewed, only after the mainnet deployment.
 // Append-only while any order of an entry is held: the cron settles holds only for entries listed here, so removing or
diff --git a/server/genesis-gold.ts b/server/genesis-gold.ts
